OL,3,GNEWSAThe film 'shining a light' on
OL,4,AGeorgia's life
OL,5,
OL,6,FFriends and family of a 17-year-old
OL,7,Fgirl who died in a crash are "turning
OL,8,Fsomething so tragic into a positive" by
OL,9,Fsharing a film about her life.
OL,11,FGeorgia Leigh Ogden died after a late
OL,12,Fnight crash involving a car being
OL,13,Fdriven by another teenager near
OL,14,FCongleton, Cheshire in 2020.
OL,16,FNow her friend Chloe Bott has produced
OL,17,Fa film about the impact of her death
OL,18,Fand has called for greater road safety
OL,19,Fmeasures, including graduated driving
OL,20,Flicences. Georgia's parents who set up
OL,21,Fa foundation in her name have also
OL,22,Fcampaigned for the licence change.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
